  "note": "Annual election of one-third of the Donaghadee Urban Council, May 1938. Only one nomination was received for the three vacancies, the other two retiring members being deemed re-elected (Belfast News-Letter, 6 May 1938, p. 13). Filed on Monday 16 May 1938, the 1938 polling day for annual-thirds towns; no poll (members deemed re-elected). (round folder corrected from \"1938-05\", 5 Nov 2026) No poll: one nomination for three seats. Returned unopposed."
